        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b0s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Dubai's upcoming property market is attracting attention once again as Nakheel prepares to introduce Palm Springs, a new residential development expected in the Jebel Ali area. With townhouses and standalone villas anticipated, the project is generating interest from property investors and from families looking to secure a home in one of Dubai's emerging development corridors.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b1",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b1s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "As anticipation builds ahead of the reported November 2026 launch window, prospective buyers are already asking about the location, expected prices, property types, payment plans and the Expression of Interest (EOI) process.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b2",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b2s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Haus of Estate takes a closer look at what is currently being reported about Palm Springs by Nakheel, what remains unconfirmed, and how interested buyers can register their interest ahead of the anticipated release.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b3",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b3s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Status at the time of writing (8 November 2026):",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "b3s1",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " we could not locate official Palm Springs project documentation on Nakheel's website. Every figure below comes from preliminary market reports and will be updated once the developer releases official material.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b4",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h2",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b4s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "What Is Palm Springs by Nakheel?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b5",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b5s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Palm Springs is an upcoming residential development attributed to Nakheel, one of Dubai's most recognised master developers, known for landmark projects including Palm Jumeirah, Palm Jebel Ali and Dubai Islands.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b6",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b6s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "The proposed development is expected to introduce a collection of family-oriented townhouses and standalone villas, offering buyers a new residential address within the wider Jebel Ali growth corridor.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b7",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b7s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Pre-launch information indicates that the development could feature three, four and five-bedroom homes, catering to different household requirements and investment budgets.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b8",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "h2",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b8s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Where Is Palm Springs Located?",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b9",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b9s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Palm Springs is reportedly located in the Jebel Ali area of Dubai, on the mainland near Palm Jebel Ali and Sheikh Zayed Road.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b10",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b10s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "The wider area is attracting attention because of major infrastructure and development projects, including Palm Jebel Ali, Dubai South and the expansion of Al Maktoum International Airport.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b11",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b11s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "For buyers considering long-term ownership, the location offers a chance to explore an emerging part of Dubai rather than focusing only on the city's established residential communities.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b12",
