          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b30",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b30s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "An Expression of Interest (EOI) is an initial step through which prospective buyers indicate their intention to purchase a property in a new development. A developer's formal EOI usually involves a deposit that is later applied to a booking or returned under the developer's terms.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b31",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b31s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Registering your interest early allows you to begin discussions with a property consultant, establish your budget and understand the purchasing options available.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b32",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b32s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "Pre-launch reports indicate that Nakheel's initial formal EOI process may prioritise buyers interested in purchasing multiple units, with a reported deposit of AED 200,000 per unit.",
            "marks": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_key": "b33",
        "_type": "block",
        "style": "normal",
        "markDefs": [],
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b33s0",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": "The eligibility criteria, deposit requirements and refund terms must be confirmed with the developer before any payment is made.",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ]
          },
          {
            "_key": "b33s1",
            "_type": "span",
            "text": " Registering your interest with Haus of Estate is not a developer EOI: it involves no payment, does not reserve a unit and does not guarantee priority.",
